# Gambling.com

> Gambling.com is an independent comparison and review platform for online gambling, founded in 2006 and covering 24 regulated markets across Europe, North America, Latin America, Oceania and India. It reviews and ranks licensed online casinos, sportsbooks, poker rooms and bingo sites, compares their bonuses, and publishes guides, news and free-to-play casino games. It does not operate gambling services. Rankings are produced by a named editorial team using a published review methodology covering licensing, bonus terms, payment methods, game selection, customer support and responsible gambling tools; every page carries its author and last-updated date. Gambling.com earns commission when a reader opens an account with a listed operator; rankings and reviews are editorial.

Content is organised by market. Each market has its own casino, bonus and sports betting rankings, operator reviews written for that market's licence regime, and localised guides. Operator lists show only operators licensed to accept players in that market.

